{"content_hash": "62fcd877cc1a50ca", "version_id": 974, "article_id": 98, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Chinese stocks slide as speculative bets collapse", "title_zh": "概念股集体跌停，A股高位筹码大出清", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8205442.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517422688858-c17ab068121c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8Y2hpbmElMjBzdG9ja3MlMjBmYWxsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3MDUwOTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Kido Dong on Unsplash", "author": "Kido Dong", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@likeakid?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/panoramic-photography-of-cn-tower-toronto-canada-1wZ5i0yhHiA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(193, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(231, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "efd1712d6bc7"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-15", "word_count": 273, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "On November 13, all five major Chinese stock indexes closed lower, and 39 stocks hit their daily limit down — one more than hit the limit up. Three of them had been lifted by hype rather than profit.", "lead_zh": "11月13日，A股五大指数全线收跌，39只个股跌停，比涨停家数还多一只。其中三只此前靠题材炒作被推高，而非业绩支撑。", "preview": "The Shanghai Composite fell 0.59% to 3634.35, while the ChiNext Index dropped 3.32%. Trading value across the two markets shrank by 276.4 bi", "preview_zh": "上证综指下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元，降至1.66万亿元。下跌个股达4748只，远超765只上涨个股。英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官后，科技股率先遭到抛售，但概念股的跌幅同样惨重。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 957, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 120.425, "size_bytes": 723456, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 122.45, "size_bytes": 735696, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 130.475, "size_bytes": 783792, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 113.0, "size_bytes": 678960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 120.8, "size_bytes": 725760, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 317, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@7c6d74a4/content/data/versions/974.json", "paragraphs": ["The Shanghai Composite fell 0.59% to 3634.35, while the ChiNext Index dropped 3.32%. Trading value across the two markets shrank by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered gainers by 4,748 to 765. The sell-off hit technology shares first, after Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as chief executive, but concept stocks suffered just as badly.", "Nanan Medical (603880) makes bandages and protective gear, which account for 65% of its revenue. Its shares had risen on flu-season and mask hype, yet revenue fell nearly 10% in the first three quarters and its net loss widened to 29 million yuan. Its gross margin is below 10% and its debt ratio is 82%. The stock is still priced almost twice its fair value.", "Xiangyang Bearing (000678) climbed eight times in fifteen trading days on robot hype, gaining about 150%. The company itself warned that its share price had drifted from its fundamentals and that robot reducer bearings barely contribute to sales. It has lost money for three straight years. After the limit-down, its premium over fair value remains 65%.", "Daye Steel (603278) rose on talk of tendon ropes for humanoid robots, but the product is still being sampled and has generated no orders. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan in the first three quarters. All three stocks trade at least 63% above fair value, and none has earnings to support the price. Investors should wait for orders and narrower losses.", "The message is simple: when hype fades, prices fall back to where they started. Traders should not treat a sharp drop as proof that a stock is cheap."], "paragraphs_zh": ["上证综指下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元，降至1.66万亿元。下跌个股达4748只，远超765只上涨个股。英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官后，科技股率先遭到抛售，但概念股的跌幅同样惨重。", "南卫股份（603880）主营创可贴和防护用品，这两类产品占收入的65%。其股价曾因流感季和口罩题材被炒高，但前三季度收入下降近10%，净亏损扩大至2900万元。公司毛利率不足10%，负债率高达82%，目前股价仍接近其合理价值的两倍。", "襄阳轴承（000678）借着机器人概念，在十五个交易日内八次涨停，累计涨幅约150%。公司自己曾提示，股价已偏离基本面，机器人减速器轴承对销售的贡献极小。公司已连续三年亏损。跌停之后，其估值仍比合理价值高出65%。", "大业股份（603278）因人形机器人腱绳的传闻而上涨，但该产品仍处于送样阶段，尚未带来任何订单。公司前三季度由盈转亏，亏损1.16亿元。这三只股票的估值都比合理价值高出至少63%，且都没有业绩支撑股价。投资者应等待订单和亏损收窄的信号。", "道理很简单：题材退潮后，股价就会跌回原点。交易者不应把急跌当作股票便宜的证明。"], "body": "The Shanghai Composite fell 0.59% to 3634.35, while the ChiNext Index dropped 3.32%. Trading value across the two markets shrank by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered gainers by 4,748 to 765. The sell-off hit technology shares first, after Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as chief executive, but concept stocks suffered just as badly.\n\nNanan Medical (603880) makes bandages and protective gear, which account for 65% of its revenue. Its shares had risen on flu-season and mask hype, yet revenue fell nearly 10% in the first three quarters and its net loss widened to 29 million yuan. Its gross margin is below 10% and its debt ratio is 82%. The stock is still priced almost twice its fair value.\n\nXiangyang Bearing (000678) climbed eight times in fifteen trading days on robot hype, gaining about 150%. The company itself warned that its share price had drifted from its fundamentals and that robot reducer bearings barely contribute to sales. It has lost money for three straight years. After the limit-down, its premium over fair value remains 65%.\n\nDaye Steel (603278) rose on talk of tendon ropes for humanoid robots, but the product is still being sampled and has generated no orders. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan in the first three quarters. All three stocks trade at least 63% above fair value, and none has earnings to support the price. Investors should wait for orders and narrower losses.\n\nThe message is simple: when hype fades, prices fall back to where they started. Traders should not treat a sharp drop as proof that a stock is cheap.", "body_zh": "上证综指下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。沪深两市成交额缩量2764亿元，降至1.66万亿元。下跌个股达4748只，远超765只上涨个股。英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官后，科技股率先遭到抛售，但概念股的跌幅同样惨重。\n\n南卫股份（603880）主营创可贴和防护用品，这两类产品占收入的65%。其股价曾因流感季和口罩题材被炒高，但前三季度收入下降近10%，净亏损扩大至2900万元。公司毛利率不足10%，负债率高达82%，目前股价仍接近其合理价值的两倍。\n\n襄阳轴承（000678）借着机器人概念，在十五个交易日内八次涨停，累计涨幅约150%。公司自己曾提示，股价已偏离基本面，机器人减速器轴承对销售的贡献极小。公司已连续三年亏损。跌停之后，其估值仍比合理价值高出65%。\n\n大业股份（603278）因人形机器人腱绳的传闻而上涨，但该产品仍处于送样阶段，尚未带来任何订单。公司前三季度由盈转亏，亏损1.16亿元。这三只股票的估值都比合理价值高出至少63%，且都没有业绩支撑股价。投资者应等待订单和亏损收窄的信号。\n\n道理很简单：题材退潮后，股价就会跌回原点。交易者不应把急跌当作股票便宜的证明。", "text": "The Shanghai Composite fell 0.59% to 3634.35, while the ChiNext Index dropped 3.32%. Trading value across the two markets shrank by 276.4 billion yuan to 1.66 trillion yuan. Decliners outnumbered gainers by 4,748 to 765. The sell-off hit technology shares first, after Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as chief executive, but concept stocks suffered just as badly. Nanan Medical (603880) makes bandages and protective gear, which account for 65% of its revenue. Its shares had risen on flu-season and mask hype, yet revenue fell nearly 10% in the first three quarters and its net loss widened to 29 million yuan. Its gross margin is below 10% and its debt ratio is 82%. The stock is still priced almost twice its fair value. Xiangyang Bearing (000678) climbed eight times in fifteen trading days on robot hype, gaining about 150%. The company itself warned that its share price had drifted from its fundamentals and that robot reducer bearings barely contribute to sales. It has lost money for three straight years. After the limit-down, its premium over fair value remains 65%. Daye Steel (603278) rose on talk of tendon ropes for humanoid robots, but the product is still being sampled and has generated no orders. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan in the first three quarters. All three stocks trade at least 63% above fair value, and none has earnings to support the price. Investors should wait for orders and narrower losses. The message is simple: when hype fades, prices fall back to where they started. Traders should not treat a sharp drop as proof that a stock is cheap.", "vocab": [{"word": "sell-off", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抛售", "note": "常指市场集中下跌", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hype", "pos": "noun", "zh": "炒作；夸大宣传", "note": "多含贬义，指靠消息推高热度", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "premium", "pos": "noun", "zh": "溢价", "note": "此处指股价高于合理价值的部分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "gross margin", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "毛利率", "note": "财务常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "debt ratio", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "负债率", "note": "衡量公司负债水平", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "swing to a loss", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "由盈转亏", "note": "swing 表示方向逆转", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fundamentals", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基本面", "note": "常用复数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drift from", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "偏离", "note": "drift 本义为漂流", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "decliner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "下跌个股", "note": "与 gainer 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shrink", "pos": "verb", "zh": "缩量；萎缩", "note": "过去式 shrank", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "contribute to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "对……有贡献", "note": "后接名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sample", "pos": "verb", "zh": "送样；取样", "note": "产品验证阶段常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-15T01:11:22.487134", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Shanghai", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.7, "sm": 325, "em": 699, "cs": 4, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Composite", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.25, "sm": 700, "em": 1250, "cs": 13, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "fell", "s": 1.25, "e": 1.5, "sm": 1250, "em": 1500, "cs": 23, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "0.59", "s": 1.5, "e": 2.97, "sm": 1500, "em": 2969, "cs": 28, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "%", "s": 2.97, "e": 3.337, "sm": 2969, "em": 3337, "cs": 32, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "to", "s": 3.337, "e": 3.487, "sm": 3337, "em": 3487, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "3634.35", "s": 3.487, "e": 6.3, "sm": 3487, "em": 6300, "cs": 37, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ",", "s": 6.3, "e": 6.4, "sm": 6300, "em": 6399, "cs": 44, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "while", "s": 6.4, "e": 6.537, "sm": 6400, "em": 6537, "cs": 46, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "the", "s": 6.537, "e": 6.625, "sm": 6537, "em": 6625, "cs": 52, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "ChiNext", "s": 6.625, "e": 7.15, "sm": 6625, "em": 7150, "cs": 56, "ce": 63, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "Index", "s": 7.15, "e": 7.838, "sm": 7150, "em": 7837, "cs": 64, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "dropped", "s": 7.838, "e": 8.187, "sm": 7837, "em": 8187, "cs": 70, "